{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "降、被也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此之三句、文通一百三十四羯磨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此句或闕　（單白內二）"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若羯磨文及白四中白、定無闕也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此之二句、文局一事也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "趨、本又作趣。音促、速也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是展轉至終。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懺主作白受懺、為僧所量、不入僧數。故須五人以上。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對首法。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即答可爾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依講堂結"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大界依院相結"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "打靜二下。復座。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸言中、應改云諸大德為羯磨阿闍梨、願\n大德為我作羯磨阿闍梨。答詞同上。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
